-- fix-botox-guide-rewrite.sql (2026-10-28)
--
-- /guides/how-long-does-botox-last, rewritten in a human tone by the writer
-- ("Revised_ How Long Does Botox Last_ Timeline, Factors & Tips (2026).docx").
-- Generated from the docx, not hand-typed. Title, slug, cover and publish date stay.
--
-- Mapping: the two intro paragraphs are the lede, "Quick Answer" the answer
-- snippet, "At a glance" the five facts, the four FAQs the inline faq. The two
-- tables keep their study links as [label](url) cells (lib/render-lexical.tsx),
-- and the 13 distinct links are the Sources list, titled from PubMed.
-- Founder calls 2026-10-28: Daxxify onset cell reads "Varies by product and endpoint", the
